# skidpad.bsn (docs/STAGE7.md, "The skidpad", nb-44): every line above this comment is
# car_basic.bsn byte for byte (test skidpad_car_is_car_basic), so the car measured on the pad
# is the car of every other check. The pad is the y = 0 ground; there are no walls.
